<title>USA: Milestone skips qtrly payment on pfd shares.</title>
<headline>Milestone skips qtrly payment on pfd shares.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milestone Properties Inc said Monday it will not pay a dividend on its $0.78 convertible series A preferred stock for the quarter ended June 30.</p>
<p>Milestone said the latest omission marks the sixth quarter for which the company skipped dividend payments on it series A preferred stock.</p>
<p>Preferred shareholders were no longer entitled to receive dividends on a cumulative basis as of September 30 1995, the company added.</p>
</text>
